Shannon Lee: Yeah, that would be great. I've heard of, like, Hotjar, but I know that it can slow down your site, uh, because it's also…

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hmm. I think that's paid. Yeah.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:18.000
Shannon Lee: Yeah, it costs money. It's not that expensive, but it's like it's same features like recorded recording. So you can see what your users are doing. But I was able to take that menu off. So there's nowhere for them to navigate but to contact me.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Good.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:22.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Contact me. Yeah, they can't do anything, but that's good.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.000
Shannon Lee: So.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:26.000
Shannon Lee: Yeah, nothing else. So I think it'll be good.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:28.000
Carmen Cruickshank: No, that's good. That's perfect.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Well, I definitely don't want to hold you, that's pretty much it, and I'll be emailing you and DMing you in the vaults, just any additional resources after today. So, yeah.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.000
Shannon Lee: Perfect. Thank you so much. I really appreciate it.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Of course, it was great meeting you and working with you, Shannon.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.000
Shannon Lee: Yeah, great meeting you too, Carmen. Have a great day.

